# Shared provider cache used by `make tf-validate` and by the CI job (one download, not seven).
.terraform-plugin-cache/
# Account-specific, and not committed: the state bucket name and the ARNs usually carry the
# account id. Copy the .example files beside them (infra/terraform/README.md).
infra/terraform/**/terraform.tfvars
infra/terraform/**/backend.hcl

